WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.367
The whole riverbank was worried.

2
00:00:03.368 --> 00:00:06.943
"Rat was away all night," said a squirrel.

3
00:00:06.944 --> 00:00:10.758
"Mole is gone too," said a robin.

4
00:00:10.759 --> 00:00:15.846
"Maybe they went to the Wild Wood!" said a deer.

5
00:00:15.847 --> 00:00:20.172
When Otter heard, he was worried too.

6
00:00:20.173 --> 00:00:23.218
"Can you find them?" asked the squirrel.

7
00:00:23.219 --> 00:00:26.834
"I’ll look for Badger’s house," Otter told them.

8
00:00:26.835 --> 00:00:31.942
"When animals get in trouble, he often helps."

9
00:00:31.943 --> 00:00:36.230
The Wild Wood was cold and empty.

10
00:00:36.231 --> 00:00:39.965
Otter found no one to ask for news.

11
00:00:39.966 --> 00:00:44.142
Then he saw a rabbit hopping by.

12
00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:48.699
"Did you see my friend Mole?" asked Otter.

13
00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:53.072
"Ahh!" screamed the rabbit, turning around.

14
00:00:53.073 --> 00:00:54.966
"You scared me!"

15
00:00:54.967 --> 00:00:58.333
"Have you seen Mole?" Otter said again.

16
00:00:58.334 --> 00:01:00.893
"Well . . . ," said the rabbit.

17
00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:03.795
"Why do you ask?"

18
00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:06.724
"Don’t play games," said Otter.

19
00:01:06.725 --> 00:01:09.406
"Did you see him?"

20
00:01:09.407 --> 00:01:12.142
Otter hit the rabbit on the head.

21
00:01:12.143 --> 00:01:16.409
"Ow!" cried the rabbit, rubbing his head.

22
00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:19.167
"You mean Rat’s friend."

23
00:01:19.168 --> 00:01:21.512
The rabbit laughed.

24
00:01:21.513 --> 00:01:24.301
"I told all the other rabbits.

25
00:01:24.302 --> 00:01:26.944
They thought it was very funny.

26
00:01:26.945 --> 00:01:33.151
Mole got lost, and he was soo scared!"

27
00:01:33.152 --> 00:01:37.310
"Why didn’t you do something?" Otter asked.

28
00:01:37.311 --> 00:01:40.258
"Like what?" asked the rabbit.

29
00:01:40.259 --> 00:01:41.512
"Take him in!

30
00:01:41.513 --> 00:01:44.479
Help him!" said Otter.

31
00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:49.395
"What? Us?" said the rabbit, confused.

32
00:01:49.396 --> 00:01:53.960
"You expect us rabbits to help anyone?"

33
00:01:53.961 --> 00:01:59.389
Shaking his head, Otter hurried on.

